.TH RAWHIDE 1
.SH NAME
rawhide \- cattle herding game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/rawhide
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I RawHide
is a cattle herding game.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
The mouse moves a horse that scares cattle;
the flock is herded through the swinging gate into the
upper-left corral.
The map is 1000x1000 pixels and larger than the window,
so the view scrolls.
Cattle may ford the river, but move at half speed off the grass,
and are blocked by the fence and the waterfall.
The clock stops when no animal is left outside the corral,
and the best time is kept between runs.
.PP
A help dialog is shown at startup; any key or mouse button dismisses it
and starts the clock.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF mouse move
.TP
.B mouse move
Move horse
.TP
.B arrows / wasd
Scroll the view
.TP
.B Enter / r
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/rawhide.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
